  "recognized_text": "Good morning. How can I help? Good morning. I'm in room 214 in a single room. My name's Sam. Hello, Sam. What can I do for you? A friend is joining me tomorrow for my last two nights. Could we change to a room for two people? I'm afraid our rooms with two beds are full tomorrow. One is free from the day after tomorrow for $85 a night. That doesn't work because he arrives tomorrow. Is there anything else? We have a family room for both nights at 110 a night, or he could have a second single room for 60. Two singles would be 120 a night, so the family room is cheaper. We'll take the family room, please. Good choice. You can move tomorrow at 12 and we can keep your bags here in the morning. Perfect. So the family room for the last two nights, 110 a night, and we move at 12. Exactly. I've changed it for you.",
  "source_text": "Good morning. How can I help? Good morning. I'm in room 214, in a single room. My name's Sam. Hello, Sam. What can I do for you? A friend is joining me tomorrow for my last two nights. Could we change to a room for two people? I'm afraid our rooms with two beds are full tomorrow. One is free from the day after tomorrow, for eighty-five dollars a night. That doesn't work, because he arrives tomorrow. Is there anything else? We have a family room for both nights at a hundred and ten a night. Or he could have a second single room for sixty. Two singles would be a hundred and twenty a night, so the family room is cheaper. We'll take the family room, please. Good choice. You can move tomorrow at twelve, and we can keep your bags here in the morning. Perfect. So, the family room for the last two nights, a hundred and ten a night, and we move at twelve. Exactly. I've changed it for you.",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good morning. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Good morning. I'm in room 214, in a single room. My name's Sam."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hello, Sam. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "A friend is joining me tomorrow for my last two nights. Could we change to a room for two people?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I'm afraid our rooms with two beds are full tomorrow. One is free from the day after tomorrow, for eighty-five dollars a night."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That doesn't work, because he arrives tomorrow. Is there anything else?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "We have a family room for both nights at a hundred and ten a night. Or he could have a second single room for sixty."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Two singles would be a hundred and twenty a night, so the family room is cheaper. We'll take the family room, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good choice. You can move tomorrow at twelve, and we can keep your bags here in the morning."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Perfect. So, the family room for the last two nights, a hundred and ten a night, and we move at twelve."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Exactly. I've changed it for you."
    }
  ],
